WEBVTT

00:00:02.030 --> 00:00:06.300
Sumimura Yoshimori, a junior high student,
and Yukimura Tokine, a high school student,

00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:08.600
must guard the land
where their school now stands.

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:12.170
To protect the Karasumori Site
from the Ayakashi.

00:00:12.170 --> 00:00:15.200
It is a duty passed down to them
from generation to generation.

00:00:16.380 --> 00:00:21.650
The dangerous forest invites me
It's showtime again tonight

00:00:21.650 --> 00:00:23.520
(Ayakashi NIGHT)

00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:28.720
Everyone's rampaging
with all their strength

00:00:28.720 --> 00:00:30.620
(Fighting late into the night)

00:00:31.130 --> 00:00:34.060
Drive away all hesitation

00:00:34.060 --> 00:00:38.470
Wanna take them on? Yeah

00:00:38.630 --> 00:00:42.000
I will protect you
(No matter what)

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:45.340
I will protect you, that's all
(that's all I want)

00:00:45.340 --> 00:00:51.010
Goodbye to the days
when all I'd do was cry

00:00:53.310 --> 00:00:55.510
Sha la la la la...

00:00:56.850 --> 00:01:01.920
I hold words in my heart
that I'd like to say

00:01:01.920 --> 00:01:03.890
(Secret romance)

00:01:03.890 --> 00:01:09.100
Standing in front of me is someone
I don't want to lose

00:01:09.100 --> 00:01:10.860
(A strange distance)

00:01:11.330 --> 00:01:17.700
I can't stand watching
people get hurt anymore

00:01:17.770 --> 00:01:18.770
Yeah

00:01:18.770 --> 00:01:22.240
I wanna be your knight
(I wanna be strong)

00:01:22.240 --> 00:01:25.850
I wanna be your light
(More than I am now)

00:01:25.850 --> 00:01:31.180
Someday I'll share with you
my 100% smile

00:01:43.800 --> 00:01:45.360
Wait. Sit down.

00:01:45.500 --> 00:01:47.630
No. You're just going to
lecture me again.

00:01:48.070 --> 00:01:51.100
That's not it.
It's going to be a long story.

00:01:52.110 --> 00:01:52.770
Huh?

00:01:53.140 --> 00:01:56.110
Gen nearly killed his own sister.

00:01:58.180 --> 00:02:00.170
Wh-What do you mean?

00:02:02.280 --> 00:02:06.150
Ever since he was born,
he's been Half-Ayakashi.

00:02:06.890 --> 00:02:09.650
That's why he never fit in
with anyone around him.

00:02:10.730 --> 00:02:13.060
Not even his family, except his sister...

00:02:13.390 --> 00:02:17.520
Gen! Gen!
I know you're there, Gen!

00:02:18.100 --> 00:02:19.630
Come down!

00:02:19.630 --> 00:02:23.260
You beat up Tsutomu Yamaguchi again,
didn't you?

00:02:24.010 --> 00:02:27.410
Come on! I'll go with you
so we can apologize together.

00:02:27.780 --> 00:02:28.940
Get down here right now!

00:02:29.380 --> 00:02:30.440
Geez...

00:02:31.750 --> 00:02:33.240
Shut up! Go away!

00:02:35.220 --> 00:02:36.480
All right. Fine then.

00:02:39.120 --> 00:02:40.990
You stay right there!

00:02:41.160 --> 00:02:42.760
G-Get away from me, idiot!

00:02:42.760 --> 00:02:45.520
Who're you calling an idiot?!
I'm your big sister!

00:02:52.770 --> 00:02:53.970
I don't know what to do here...

00:02:53.970 --> 00:02:58.130
I just can't have such a violent child
anywhere near my dear Tsutomu!

00:02:58.270 --> 00:02:59.970
I'm really sorry.

00:03:01.210 --> 00:03:03.340
I'll be sure to give him a good scolding.

00:03:04.110 --> 00:03:06.710
What's her problem?
"My dear Tsutomu," whatever!

00:03:07.080 --> 00:03:10.980
How dare she say that
when we're apologizing?! Right?

00:03:21.660 --> 00:03:22.320
Come on.

00:03:23.160 --> 00:03:24.150
Come here.

00:03:24.370 --> 00:03:26.130
We didn't need to apologize.

00:03:27.570 --> 00:03:32.210
But Gen, just because the other kid makes
fun of you doesn't mean you can hit him.

00:03:32.210 --> 00:03:34.570
That makes you in the wrong.
Do you understand?

00:03:35.240 --> 00:03:36.470
Come on! Let's go.

00:03:40.980 --> 00:03:44.250
Don't give me that look!
Let's go!

00:03:45.850 --> 00:03:51.620
I just don't get it.
You never pick fights with anyone, right?

00:03:52.560 --> 00:03:54.360
So I wonder why you find yourself
in so much trouble...

00:03:58.130 --> 00:03:59.720
You're such a good boy, too.

00:04:05.540 --> 00:04:08.380
You can't do anything unless
your big sister's with you!

00:04:08.380 --> 00:04:09.480
You suck!

00:04:09.480 --> 00:04:11.410
Hey! Stop it, Tsutomu-kun!

00:04:11.750 --> 00:04:14.480
Shut up! Take this!

00:04:18.920 --> 00:04:19.950
Serves you right!

00:04:19.950 --> 00:04:21.050
You're all dirty!

00:04:23.160 --> 00:04:24.180
Wait right th-

00:04:34.700 --> 00:04:37.270
Help!

00:04:37.270 --> 00:04:38.640
Gen! How could you?!

00:04:42.540 --> 00:04:44.510
I'll get him.

00:04:48.380 --> 00:04:49.370
Wait!

00:04:53.720 --> 00:04:55.820
I'll never forgive him.

00:04:55.820 --> 00:04:57.550
What happened to your hand!?

00:04:58.430 --> 00:04:59.790
Huh? What?

00:05:03.000 --> 00:05:04.490
What's wrong, Sis?

00:05:05.470 --> 00:05:07.490
Nothing. Nothing at all...

00:05:09.970 --> 00:05:11.940
What was that?

00:05:31.460 --> 00:05:33.790
Huh? Why am I here?

00:05:33.860 --> 00:05:35.020
Is that true?

00:05:36.100 --> 00:05:38.290
Yeah. It's true.
There's no mistake.

00:05:39.330 --> 00:05:42.360
It seems like he used
a knife this time.

00:05:43.300 --> 00:05:44.290
A knife!

00:05:44.910 --> 00:05:47.140
Is Tsutomu-kun all right?

00:05:47.440 --> 00:05:52.610
It's not as bad as it looks.
But he's traumatized.

00:05:53.150 --> 00:05:59.380
He's delirious and keeps repeating
over and over... that Gen is a monster...

00:06:04.890 --> 00:06:06.990
Could this be retribution
for us seeking strength?

00:06:08.430 --> 00:06:11.060
People like him are born in our family
from time to time.

00:06:12.000 --> 00:06:14.400
I talked to your mother about it,

00:06:14.400 --> 00:06:17.700
there is a special organization
that will take people like him.

00:06:18.110 --> 00:06:20.510
Take him? You mean Gen?

00:06:21.110 --> 00:06:23.540
I already asked them.
They'll be here soon.

00:06:23.750 --> 00:06:26.110
Wait. How can you do that to
your own son so easily?!

00:06:26.380 --> 00:06:27.410
It wasn't easy!

00:06:29.920 --> 00:06:32.010
It wasn't an easy decision.

00:06:32.650 --> 00:06:37.560
But this is best for everyone.
Before someone else gets hurt.

00:06:38.560 --> 00:06:39.580
Please understand.

00:06:40.060 --> 00:06:41.090
Dad...

00:06:50.410 --> 00:06:51.870
You're right...

00:06:58.310 --> 00:07:00.470
Damn. It's started.

00:07:06.990 --> 00:07:07.980
Gen...

00:07:10.930 --> 00:07:13.330
The boy's name is Shishio Gen,
10 years old.

00:07:13.490 --> 00:07:16.160
He's Half-Ayakashi,
and he's an Integrated Type...

00:07:16.930 --> 00:07:20.490
He's still running wild in the mountains,
while emitting Negative Energy.

00:07:21.940 --> 00:07:23.370
Yes. That's right.

00:07:24.010 --> 00:07:26.530
He has awakened.
Requesting backup.

00:07:29.080 --> 00:07:31.100
What's with that kid?
His eyes are so creepy.

00:07:31.150 --> 00:07:32.080
He's weird.

00:07:32.110 --> 00:07:33.980
- So scary!
- Just look at him!

00:07:34.020 --> 00:07:35.180
Don't go near him.

00:07:36.420 --> 00:07:40.380
Damn it! Damn it!
Damn it! Why?!

00:07:41.020 --> 00:07:44.190
I know it's not your fault, Gen.

00:07:44.990 --> 00:07:48.190
It's okay. Your Big Sister will
always be here to protect you.

00:07:49.660 --> 00:07:50.690
Sis.

00:07:54.040 --> 00:07:57.060
You said you were going to protect me!

00:07:57.710 --> 00:08:02.670
You're one of us.
We're monsters, so let's get along.

00:08:05.580 --> 00:08:07.010
M-Monster!

00:08:10.690 --> 00:08:11.950
Monster...

00:08:20.060 --> 00:08:21.190
It's gotten a lot quieter.

00:08:24.900 --> 00:08:25.890
Chief!

00:08:26.600 --> 00:08:28.570
Hiba, how's your arm?

00:08:29.570 --> 00:08:31.630
You didn't have to
come here yourself, Chief.

00:08:32.140 --> 00:08:34.040
Never mind that.
What's the situation?

00:08:34.680 --> 00:08:38.010
He was struggling violently earlier,
but he's much calmer now.

00:08:38.410 --> 00:08:40.280
We better catch him quick.

00:08:41.020 --> 00:08:41.670
Yes.

00:08:41.950 --> 00:08:43.140
Chief! I'll go with you.

00:08:43.520 --> 00:08:44.850
Rest your arm.

00:08:46.790 --> 00:08:49.850
Kurohime! Locate the boy and
monitor his condition for me first!

00:09:09.740 --> 00:09:11.180
This is bad! I should hurry!

00:09:11.480 --> 00:09:12.170
Chief!

00:09:15.280 --> 00:09:17.620
Hold onto it. I won't need it.

00:09:24.190 --> 00:09:26.180
Gen, I'm sorry.

00:09:26.960 --> 00:09:28.520
What did Gen do?!

00:09:29.560 --> 00:09:32.000
I promised I would protect you.

00:09:33.070 --> 00:09:34.560
Did they do something to you again?

00:09:35.600 --> 00:09:36.870
You're such a crybaby.

00:09:38.740 --> 00:09:44.680
I'm sorry. I let go of your hand,
when you needed me the most.

00:09:45.910 --> 00:09:46.900
Gen?!

00:09:49.820 --> 00:09:51.840
I'm sorry! Gen!

00:10:02.100 --> 00:10:03.690
Gen, I know you're there.

00:10:04.800 --> 00:10:08.000
Listen to me. We didn't mean that
we don't want you anymore.

00:10:10.540 --> 00:10:12.010
What Dad said was...

00:10:14.810 --> 00:10:18.940
I'm sorry. No matter what happens,
you're still my precious little brother.

00:10:19.350 --> 00:10:23.810
I'll never let anyone say anything
about taking you away! Never!

00:10:30.760 --> 00:10:32.850
Gen! Let's go home!
Come down here!

00:10:33.760 --> 00:10:36.700
I'm going to take you home
even if I have to drag you!

00:10:38.030 --> 00:10:39.030
Don't come!

00:10:39.030 --> 00:10:40.020
Gen!

00:10:41.540 --> 00:10:42.520
Wait!

00:10:49.480 --> 00:10:50.470
Big Sister!

00:10:58.950 --> 00:11:00.150
Am I too late?

00:11:01.520 --> 00:11:04.960
Shiki, close up the wound.
Be careful.

00:11:05.860 --> 00:11:06.990
Hiba, I got one severely injured.

00:11:07.560 --> 00:11:09.290
Get the Medical Team here now.

00:11:10.030 --> 00:11:11.360
I'm going after the boy.

00:11:16.140 --> 00:11:17.500
G-Gen...

00:11:18.010 --> 00:11:20.340
I'm... sorry...

00:11:25.850 --> 00:11:28.580
I've had enough!
Everyone hates me!

00:11:28.820 --> 00:11:29.810
Even my own big sister!

00:11:35.260 --> 00:11:40.130
Damn it! I hate everyone!

00:11:49.540 --> 00:11:51.000
What are you?!

00:11:51.570 --> 00:11:53.010
I came to capture you.

00:11:53.410 --> 00:11:54.400
Shut up!

00:11:54.540 --> 00:11:57.310
I hate all humans!

00:11:57.450 --> 00:11:58.430
Tears?

00:12:03.920 --> 00:12:05.680
I might not be able to capture him
without getting hurt...

00:12:16.830 --> 00:12:17.820
Forgive me.

00:12:23.400 --> 00:12:26.930
What's this?
Am I... going to die?

00:12:28.580 --> 00:12:34.380
Good. Now no one...
will ever... hate me...

00:12:40.960 --> 00:12:42.580
Hey, you're awake.

00:12:50.200 --> 00:12:52.720
I'm sorry, but I put that on you
without your consent.

00:12:53.400 --> 00:12:55.200
You're messing with me.

00:12:57.770 --> 00:12:59.000
What did you do to my body-

00:13:02.380 --> 00:13:04.640
That Flame Tattoo is a form of restraint.

00:13:05.480 --> 00:13:09.020
When you try to
release your powers,

00:13:09.020 --> 00:13:12.290
it will cause a searing pain
all over your body...

00:13:12.290 --> 00:13:13.620
You!

00:13:13.790 --> 00:13:17.190
Do you understand what you've done?

00:13:21.100 --> 00:13:25.090
At first, I was going to send you home
after giving you that tattoo.

00:13:25.770 --> 00:13:28.560
But I changed my mind.
You can't live there anymore.

00:13:31.570 --> 00:13:33.600
How's my big sister?

00:13:35.980 --> 00:13:37.670
She'll survive.

00:13:42.150 --> 00:13:45.810
From now on, you will train to
learn how to use your powers.

00:13:46.650 --> 00:13:48.350
I heard from your father...

00:13:49.360 --> 00:13:52.590
You were given the name Gen
in the hope that you would be humble,

00:13:52.590 --> 00:13:55.930
have self-control,
and understand your own strength.

00:13:57.330 --> 00:14:00.270
I think you can do them all.

00:14:01.270 --> 00:14:03.400
Until then, you can stay here.

00:14:05.670 --> 00:14:07.440
Hey! Let's start!

00:14:22.960 --> 00:14:25.550
This is Hanashima Atora.
She'll be your instructor.

00:14:26.060 --> 00:14:29.290
Hi! My training is
going to be really tough.

00:14:29.500 --> 00:14:30.960
Her specialty is monster taming.

00:14:31.330 --> 00:14:33.460
And you're the monster!

00:14:33.870 --> 00:14:37.070
I don't want to hear it from you,
you masked freak!

00:14:39.440 --> 00:14:42.970
This group is still new,
so a lot of them are young.

00:14:43.810 --> 00:14:45.370
There are plenty of members your age.

00:14:46.910 --> 00:14:47.970
Welcome!

00:14:49.080 --> 00:14:52.780
To the outcasts of the Shadow Organization,
the Night Troops!

00:14:54.420 --> 00:14:59.790
But even after that, there were times
when Gen was unable to control his powers.

00:15:00.860 --> 00:15:05.490
There was strong dissent...
but I assigned him to Karasumori anyway.

00:15:06.800 --> 00:15:09.500
I thought you and Gen would get along.

00:15:11.740 --> 00:15:14.970
I don't think my decision was wrong.

00:15:16.180 --> 00:15:18.510
What should I do?

00:15:19.980 --> 00:15:22.780
I've told you everything
you wanted to know.

00:15:24.080 --> 00:15:26.310
You want to break the walls
around Gen, right?

00:15:26.750 --> 00:15:27.950
Think about what
you should do yourself.

00:15:28.320 --> 00:15:30.380
I don't know what to do.

00:15:31.190 --> 00:15:32.390
You don't know?

00:15:33.830 --> 00:15:35.230
Don't let go of Gen's hand.

00:15:37.430 --> 00:15:39.060
That's all.

00:15:48.840 --> 00:15:51.370
What?! You're going already?

00:15:51.680 --> 00:15:53.270
I have people waiting for me.

00:15:53.680 --> 00:15:55.710
Oh, then I guess it can't be helped.

00:15:55.750 --> 00:15:57.010
Where's Grandfather?

00:15:57.250 --> 00:15:58.240
Well...

00:15:59.550 --> 00:16:01.040
So he's still mad at me.

00:16:02.190 --> 00:16:03.180
Oh, well.

00:16:04.330 --> 00:16:06.690
Um, about Yoshimori...

00:16:07.460 --> 00:16:11.300
About that...
He'll have to resolve it on his own.

00:16:11.630 --> 00:16:12.720
Oh, I see.

00:16:12.830 --> 00:16:13.990
I'm off.

00:16:15.100 --> 00:16:16.500
All right. Take care.

00:16:17.500 --> 00:16:18.240
Oh!

00:16:18.240 --> 00:16:19.470
What is it?

00:16:20.410 --> 00:16:22.310
The tempura was delicious.

00:16:23.540 --> 00:16:26.140
Just come home whenever
you feel like eating it.

00:16:32.920 --> 00:16:35.860
Hiba. There's a favor
I want to ask of you.

00:16:41.060 --> 00:16:42.050
I wonder why?

00:16:43.030 --> 00:16:47.520
I haven't been told anything.
Did Hiba-san let me off easy?

00:16:49.240 --> 00:16:52.570
I doubt it. He hates me.

00:16:53.970 --> 00:16:57.540
Whatever. They hate me anyway.

00:16:59.450 --> 00:17:02.380
But they won't hate me anymore now.

00:17:03.950 --> 00:17:05.820
So that's what happened to Gen-kun...

00:17:07.120 --> 00:17:09.420
Is he just going to go back?

00:17:09.960 --> 00:17:12.930
Tokine, what should I do?

00:17:13.160 --> 00:17:15.630
I don't know. This is really hard.

00:17:15.630 --> 00:17:18.620
Come on. You're my only hope.

00:17:18.670 --> 00:17:20.790
Oh, my. Look at you being so pathetic.

00:17:20.870 --> 00:17:23.770
Yoshi, you really shouldn't
depend on others.

00:17:24.040 --> 00:17:27.130
Shut up! I don't want to be
lectured by a dog.

00:17:27.440 --> 00:17:29.970
Anyway, let's go look for him.
He should already be here.

00:17:38.720 --> 00:17:42.180
I think you're perfect for this job.

00:17:43.090 --> 00:17:46.860
I betrayed the Chief's expectations.
There's no place for me anymore.

00:17:46.860 --> 00:17:48.050
Hey! Shishio!

00:17:48.700 --> 00:17:51.290
H-Hey! Don't you think
it's nice out tonight?

00:17:53.500 --> 00:18:01.040
Hey... I don't know how to put this...
Um, it's all jumbled up in my head!

00:18:01.040 --> 00:18:02.130
Tokine!

00:18:03.780 --> 00:18:06.840
You're so hopeless. Leave it to me.

00:18:07.280 --> 00:18:10.340
Gen-kun, Yoshimori
has something to say to you.

00:18:11.090 --> 00:18:12.680
Tokine! You!

00:18:12.920 --> 00:18:13.910
He ran away!

00:18:14.150 --> 00:18:16.150
Wait, why is he running away?

00:18:20.590 --> 00:18:24.830
They're so naïve. They were probably
just going to say goodbye.

00:18:26.100 --> 00:18:29.330
No. Maybe he wants to complain
one last time before I go.

00:18:29.670 --> 00:18:30.800
Wait!

00:18:34.170 --> 00:18:35.200
Hey!

00:18:35.710 --> 00:18:37.370
Wait!

00:18:38.350 --> 00:18:39.950
Hey, Yoshimori!

00:18:39.950 --> 00:18:42.010
How long are you
going to keep running?!

00:18:44.050 --> 00:18:47.210
Are you that scared of someone
finding out about your past?!

00:18:54.530 --> 00:18:57.790
My big brother told me everything,
about you and your sister.

00:18:59.830 --> 00:19:00.820
That idiot.

00:19:01.070 --> 00:19:02.800
What a fastball.

00:19:03.070 --> 00:19:05.560
A Major League fastball, Yoshi.

00:19:08.840 --> 00:19:11.540
What are you doing?!
You want to fight?

00:19:12.210 --> 00:19:13.800
If that's what you want.

00:19:14.250 --> 00:19:15.880
Bring it on! Come on!

00:19:17.890 --> 00:19:19.520
Hey, you guys!

00:19:19.520 --> 00:19:20.990
Leave them alone, honey.

00:19:21.220 --> 00:19:27.650
Yeah. Boys are stupid, sometimes
they have to fight it out.

00:19:27.930 --> 00:19:28.920
But...

00:19:35.600 --> 00:19:37.900
Hey, you guys.

00:19:38.070 --> 00:19:40.340
Was it really okay that
I didn't stop them?

00:19:40.340 --> 00:19:42.540
- Huh? Umm...
- Huh? Umm...

00:19:42.580 --> 00:19:43.570
Ketsu!

00:19:44.380 --> 00:19:46.970
Your Kekkai are weak as paper!

00:19:47.380 --> 00:19:49.710
Then how about this?! Ketsu!

00:19:51.080 --> 00:19:51.820
What?!

00:19:51.820 --> 00:19:53.840
Ketsu! Ketsu! Ketsu!

00:19:58.030 --> 00:20:01.220
He used small Kekkai
to hold down my joints.

00:20:01.530 --> 00:20:02.520
Listen to me!

00:20:02.860 --> 00:20:07.030
If you ask them, they might
forgive you this time!

00:20:07.300 --> 00:20:09.360
I don't want anybody's pity.

00:20:09.800 --> 00:20:11.240
I want you to stay here!

00:20:12.910 --> 00:20:15.970
Stop being... so naïve!

00:20:16.710 --> 00:20:18.510
I believe in you.

00:20:19.210 --> 00:20:20.940
Shut up!

00:20:21.750 --> 00:20:22.770
Yoshimori!

00:20:22.880 --> 00:20:25.410
I actually have lots of reasons.

00:20:25.990 --> 00:20:28.610
But I thought that you
would do well with Yoshimori.

00:20:37.730 --> 00:20:39.290
I need you.

00:20:46.010 --> 00:20:47.100
You're so stupid!

00:20:47.540 --> 00:20:51.100
Even if you need me,
I'm going to be relieved of this post.

00:20:51.480 --> 00:20:53.140
Can't you do something to stay?

00:20:53.210 --> 00:20:54.200
That's right!

00:20:54.350 --> 00:20:59.550
I hope you can stay and fight with us.
Yoshimori can be unreliable sometimes.

00:20:59.550 --> 00:21:00.750
What?!

00:21:01.460 --> 00:21:03.360
If the Chief decides to remove me-

00:21:03.360 --> 00:21:04.930
I won't let him do that!

00:21:04.930 --> 00:21:06.950
No matter what my damn,
stupid brother says!

00:21:10.130 --> 00:21:12.390
Hey. You got a minute?

00:21:14.030 --> 00:21:15.020
Hiba-san...

00:21:16.070 --> 00:21:18.870
Wait just a second! I don't know
what my big brother told you, but-

00:21:18.870 --> 00:21:20.640
You're staying!

00:21:23.080 --> 00:21:24.510
Staying?

00:21:24.810 --> 00:21:26.180
He's not getting canned?

00:21:26.550 --> 00:21:28.140
But consider yourself officially warned.

00:21:28.350 --> 00:21:30.710
The next time you go out of control,
you're out!

00:21:33.590 --> 00:21:35.780
Th-Thank you very much, Hiba-san!

00:21:36.190 --> 00:21:39.780
The decision wasn't mine. So long.

00:21:42.060 --> 00:21:45.590
Damn it. Why did the Chief make
me the messenger?

00:21:46.070 --> 00:21:47.560
He can be so cruel sometimes.

00:21:49.070 --> 00:21:50.900
This is great, Shishio!

00:21:50.900 --> 00:21:51.960
Stop it!

00:21:52.040 --> 00:21:53.700
Now it's just like how it used to be.

00:21:53.870 --> 00:21:55.910
Gengen, this is amazing!

00:21:55.910 --> 00:21:57.770
Good for you, I guess.

00:22:01.520 --> 00:22:05.380
Now that it's settled,
you have to clean up, Yoshimori!

00:22:07.890 --> 00:22:09.820
Wait, I have to clean this up?!

00:22:09.820 --> 00:22:11.120
Of course!

00:22:11.360 --> 00:22:14.920
You guys did this.
I'm not going to help.

00:22:17.260 --> 00:22:19.290
Gen! You're helping!

00:22:20.470 --> 00:22:22.370
My specialty is breaking things.

00:22:24.740 --> 00:22:28.870
I need you to clean this up!

00:22:46.860 --> 00:22:52.390
10 minute break,
I wanna do so much

00:22:54.270 --> 00:23:00.300
Class is over, but someone
in the front asks a question

00:23:00.670 --> 00:23:02.840
"What nerve"

00:23:03.240 --> 00:23:06.210
I'm at ease as long as
I have a mirror

00:23:06.250 --> 00:23:09.940
"Make up's on right,
my eyes look all right"

00:23:09.980 --> 00:23:16.320
See, if you look behind you,
there's a girl who curled her hair

00:23:16.660 --> 00:23:21.360
I hate studying,
I like P.E. Okay

00:23:21.400 --> 00:23:23.300
Basketball, volleyball,
and tennis, what?

00:23:23.330 --> 00:23:28.560
You're not gonna make me
run long distance today, teacher!

00:23:28.600 --> 00:23:32.090
My face will get oily,
and I hate being sore

00:23:32.140 --> 00:23:36.200
I'm that kind of
a beautiful high school girl

00:23:50.690 --> 00:24:01.030
10 minute break, I'll get busy
drawing a map of the future
